      "description": "MiMo Hothead mulliganed a 4-card hand containing a land (Plains) and three playable spells (Get Lost, No More Lies, Stock Up) down to 2 cards. While the hand is light on lands with only one Plains, it has premium interaction and card selection. A 4-card hand with a land and relevant spells is almost always better than an unknown 2-card hand.",
